    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Once Shirail is rank 1 and has a physical body, she gains the following divine innate spells. As her rank increases, her occult spell DC and spell attack modifier increase, and she gains additional innate spells.\n\nDivine Innate Spells DC 22, attack +14; 3rd Cleanse Affliction, Heal; 2nd Cleanse Affliction, Heal, Sound Body; 1st Cleanse Cuisine, Heal, Spirit Link; Cantrips (3rd) Detect Magic, Divine Lance, Light, Read Aura, Vitality Lash\n\nRank 2 DC 24, attack +16; 4th Cleanse Affliction; 3rd Locate. Her cantrips are heightened to 4th rank.\n\nRank 3 DC 26, attack +18; 5th Sound Body; 4th Vital Beacon. Her cantrips are heightened to 5th rank."
